{
  "$comment": [
    "Model table for the bedrock and bedrock-app profiles managed by claude_switch.",
    "",
    "id              Anthropic model ID; the modelOverrides key. Dated IDs keep their suffix.",
    "family          Maps to ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_<FAMILY>_MODEL: opus|sonnet|haiku|fable.",
    "rank            Lowest rank in a family wins that family's alias pin.",
    "bedrock         System-defined inference profile ID used by `bedrock` mode.",
    "foundationModel Join key matching a discovered application inference profile.",
    "longContext     Whether the [1m] suffix is appended to the pin.",
    "capabilities    ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_<FAMILY>_MODEL_SUPPORTED_CAPABILITIES. Setting it",
    "                DISABLES anything not listed. Valid tokens: effort, xhigh_effort,",
    "                max_effort, thinking, adaptive_thinking, interleaved_thinking.",
    "",
    "Only the four family pins can carry capabilities, so in bedrock-app mode the older",
    "versions reached through modelOverrides fall back to Claude Code's own detection,",
    "which cannot read an opaque profile ARN. Use `bedrock` mode for those."
  ],
